WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:08.034
Sound, motion and display: how Telo Ride sounds and moves for an hour in the saddle.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.471
Ride sound is made in the browser from your pedalling: chain, freewheel, tyres and

00:00:15.471 --> 00:00:18.658
wind. Turn it off, and no audio starts at all.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:28.472
World music plays each world's own track underneath. Under a class video, ride sound

00:00:28.472 --> 00:00:30.895
goes quiet until the video pauses.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:41.312
Reduce motion follows the device, or your choice. On, every transition is instant,

00:00:41.312 --> 00:00:44.139
and the world stops swaying in the wind.

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:53.822
Large ride numbers make power, the clock and the target a quarter bigger on every

00:00:53.822 --> 00:00:56.779
ride screen, with nothing scrolling sideways.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:04.918
Sound and display, from a phone to the full screen.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:16.967
The theme matches the device, or stays as you pick it. And with full screen on, the

00:01:16.967 --> 00:01:18.909
start press goes full screen.

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:29.774
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:30.119 --> 00:01:34.631
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:34.631 --> 00:01:36.302
every hill and interval.

00:01:36.647 --> 00:01:41.825
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:41.825 --> 00:01:47.273
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:50.263
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:01:50.608 --> 00:01:53.101
A custom workout lives under Profile.
